        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 800CE, Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple Chelsea handle features oval mounts and classic two piece design. It will look great for traditional homes. Single cylinder is operated by key outside, turn knob inside. This Kwikset 800CE Handleset has solid brass construction and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> the latchbolt is operated by a thumbpiece outside and grip inside. The deadbolt is operated by a key outside and a thumbturn inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching:\r\n\r\n<a href=\"/products/chelsea-dummy-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-802ce\"><b>Chelsea Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Two Piece Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li> SmartKey cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>10 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 800CE Oval Chelsea Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Bottom Plate: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
