                "title": "Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset, Kwikset 800CE",
                "description": "Kwikset 800CE Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset - This simple Chelsea handle features oval mounts and classic two piece design. It will look great for traditional homes. Single cylinder is operated by key outside, turn knob inside. This Kwikset 800CE Handleset has solid brass construction and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty. Good for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
